                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1dc6a1e-e45a-3e45-8cbb-871e5222c957",
                        "entry_id": "561b9cd0-dbcb-3723-bdfd-b980df7dd1ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "graft, gift for unlawful service, palm-oil"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8e233d0-ab64-4282-9151-e6310de9417b",
                                "sense_id": "c1dc6a1e-e45a-3e45-8cbb-871e5222c957",
                                "text": "А дьяка Истому совсем не признать в приказчике, запоясанном по кожану здоровым черезом, чуть не с аршинными кожаными ж варягами на руках, привыкших к калыму письменному.",
                                "translation": "But Dyak Istoma one can hardly recognize in the clerk, girdled before the leather-coat with a great bysack-belt, almost with sprawled leather Vikings on the hands, wont of written grafts.",
                                "english": "But Dyak Istoma one can hardly recognize in the clerk, girdled before the leather-coat with a great bysack-belt, almost with sprawled leather Vikings on the hands, wont of written grafts."
                            }
                        ]
